          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "സഹോദരി — sahōdari — \"a sister\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "അവന്റെ സഹോദരി ഒരു നഴ്സാണ്. avanṟe sahōdari oru naḻsāṇŭ. His sister is a nurse."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "At home, ചേച്ചി or അനിയത്തി."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
