          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "സഹോദരി (sahōdari) is borrowed from Sanskrit sahodarī, the feminine of sahodara, \"born of the same womb\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
